@startuml student-service-class-diagram
title Level 3: Code - Class Diagram (student-service) - FR-01\nOwner: Ahmed Mohamed Ahmed
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
  BackgroundColor<<component>> #D5EFE0
  BorderColor<<component>> #2E8B57
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}
hide empty members

legend right
  |<#D5EFE0>   | Class of a component |
  |<#FFFFFF>   | Interface / domain class |
  | Solid arrow, open head | Uses (required interface / class) |
  | Dotted arrow, hollow head | Implements (provided interface) |
  | Filled diamond | Composition |
  | Plain line | Association |
endlegend

interface IStudentProfile <<provided>> {
  +CreateProfileAsync(studentId, data): ServiceResult<Profile>
  +UpdateProfileAsync(studentId, data): ServiceResult<Profile>
  +GetProfileAsync(studentId): ServiceResult<Profile>
  +GetAvailabilityAsync(studentId): ServiceResult<List<TimeSlot>>
}

class StudentProfileService <<component>> {
  -repository: IProfileRepository
  --
  +CreateProfileAsync(...)
  +UpdateProfileAsync(...)
  +GetProfileAsync(...)
  +GetAvailabilityAsync(...)
}

interface IProfileRepository <<required - Database>> {
  +AddAsync(profile): Task
  +GetByIdAsync(studentId): Task<Profile?>
  +Update(profile): void
  +SaveChangesAsync(): Task<int>
}

class ProfileRepository <<component>> {
  -context: StudentDbContext
  --
  +AddAsync(...) / GetByIdAsync(...)
  +Update(...) / SaveChangesAsync(...)
}

class StudentDbContext {
  +Profiles: DbSet<Profile>
  +TimeSlots: DbSet<TimeSlot>
}

class Profile {
  -studentId: String
  -academicLevel: String
  -major: String
  -interests: List<String>
  -skills: List<String>
  -careerInterests: List<String>
  -availability: List<TimeSlot>
  --
  +isComplete(): boolean
}
class TimeSlot {
  -timeSlotId: String
  -studentId: String
  -dayOfWeek: String
  -startTime: TimeOnly
  -endTime: TimeOnly
}

IStudentProfile <|.. StudentProfileService
StudentProfileService --> IProfileRepository
ProfileRepository ..|> IProfileRepository
ProfileRepository --> StudentDbContext
StudentDbContext --> Profile
Profile *-- "1..*" TimeSlot : availability
note bottom of StudentProfileService
SOLID applied:
S - StudentProfileService coordinates; ProfileRepository persists; StudentDbContext maps.
O - new behaviour is added by new implementations, not by editing StudentProfileService.
L - StudentProfileService can replace any other IStudentProfile implementation.
I - IStudentProfile has only the operations its clients use.
D - StudentProfileService depends on IProfileRepository, not on ProfileRepository.
end note
@enduml
